5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us choose an exhibition that brings joy to our visitors and peace to our hardworking staff. I shall look into the conservation lab staffing and backlog, and the composition of the volunteer roster.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure we don't repeat past mistakes, I will examine the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays. I prefer to see where things actually fail.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help pick our next big show. To make sure we actually give the people what they want, I'll check the five years of visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts across ten seasons!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I believe we should consider the physical limits of our space. I will look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm so happy to be here! I want to find out where all the secret money goes, so I'll look into the loan transport costs over three seasons and the mount-making charges and joiner's rate!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see such a diverse range of interests. By looking at both the physical space and the hearts of our visitors, we shall surely find a path that is kind to everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Diverse interests are fine, but optimism is not a strategy. I am more interested in the friction points. If we ignore the logistical failures of the past, we are simply planning for another disaster.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, you're such a killjoy! Let's not call it a disaster before we've even started. I think a little bit of excitement is exactly what we need to make this exhibition a hit!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, excitement is fine, but it doesn't change the physical capacity of the building. We need to be realistic about what the gallery can actually handle before we commit to a vision.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, you're so serious! But that's why I'm here to find the mysteries! If we know where the money disappears, maybe we can use it for something super cool and sparkly!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a joy to see such lively spirits. While we seek the sparkly and the exciting, let us remember that the hands that build these dreams are precious. I hope our findings bring us clarity.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Clarity is only useful if it is based on reality. I suspect we will find that our ""dreams"" are often derailed by simple paperwork and technical glitches. I look forward to seeing who is actually paying attention.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, you're always so focused on the glitches! I'm more interested in the glamour and the crowds. Let's see if the data shows that people actually like the ""safe"" choices you prefer!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, glamour doesn't prevent a floor from sagging or a schedule from clashing. I am simply looking for the boundaries of our reality so we don't overpromise.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@May, I'm with you! Let's make it a big party! But I'll be the detective and find the hidden money traps so we can spend it on the fun stuff! I can't wait!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Let us move forward with a spirit of harmony. I believe that by combining our different perspectives, we will find a choice that is both beautiful for the public and sustainable for our dear colleagues.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Harmony is a pleasant sentiment, but I prefer precision. Let us see if the records reflect the same optimism you all feel. I am ready to uncover the truth.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready too! Let's see if the visitors have been as honest in their comments as we are being now. I'll be waiting to see what all your boring reports actually say!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I am also ready. I hope the data provides a clear picture of our constraints so we can make a decision that is actually sustainable for the building.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm super ready! I'm going to dive into those numbers and solve the mystery of the disappearing money! See you all soon with my detective report!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
